            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "#**The diameter of the ceiling fan will be determined by your area. When you buy a ceiling fan, usually there is a recommended area already stated.<ref>[v161517_b01]. 18 August 2020.</ref>",
                    "#Think about electricity. Since fans require the same amount of power as most ceiling fixtures, the electrical circuit shouldn’t be overloaded.<ref>https://www.thisoldhouse.com/fans/21018783/how-to-size-up-a-ceiling-fan</ref> [[Image:Choose the Right Ceiling Fan Step 3.jpg|center]]"
                ],
                "removed": [
