            "contribution_type": "addition",
            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "*Always mount a ceiling fan with the blades at least {{convert|7|ft|m|1}} above the floor, even if this requires a close-to-ceiling mount.  A ceiling fan hanging too low can hit somebody's head and cause injury.  Also, building codes in many jurisdictions prohibit ceiling fans from being mounted with the blades less than {{convert|7|ft|m|1}}."
                ],
                "removed": [
